          },
          {
            "name": "User-Agent",
            "value": ""
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "type": "multipart-form",
          "data": []
        }
      },
      "docs": "Upload a file once, get back a `file_*` reference id to reuse across generations.\n\nThe same reference can be used in realtime `set_image { image_ref }` and (after PR2)\nin batch/queue endpoints via `data_ref` / `reference_image_ref` Form fields."
    },
